      "image": "assets/images/222416/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle salt on a small plate. Lightly wet the rim of a cocktail glass or margarita glass with a damp paper towel. Dip the moistened rim in salt to coat. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9W1oDgt6UQswL9Ugyr1Qgs63b_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222416-maragrita-cocktail-ddmfs-Step2-0303-82de936ee6be4a379a7a36bdbdf0ef96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222416/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine tequila, orange-flavored brandy, and lime juice in a cocktail shaker. Add ice and shake until chilled. Strain into a salt-rimmed cocktail glass or a salt-rimmed, ice-filled margarita glass. Garnish with a lime wheel.",
